{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2019-10-30 22:30:00', 'title': 'DOMINION ENERGY DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYABLE ON DEC. 20, 2019', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF DOMINION ENERGY HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 91.75 CENTS PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK. DIVIDENDS ARE PAYABLE ON DEC. 20, 2019, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS DEC. 6, 2019.'}